From 0e84243be47ec7e64c6c6fb1d32c9fa2833b264e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cmspam <cmspam@localhost>
Date: Thu, 9 Apr 2026 03:41:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] WINQ-EMU Alpha 1: Windows Venus port

Complete Windows port of the Venus Vulkan forwarding protocol:
- Win32 external memory translation shim (fd -> Win32 handles)
- Push descriptor layout compatibility fix
- Deferred object destruction for driver stability
- GL error handling for Windows GL drivers
- Queue creation lifetime fix
- Proxy/server Windows socket and threading support
